  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Medicines for Malaria Venture to discover, develop and deliver new, effective and affordable antimalarial medicines.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the burden of malaria in low- and middle-income countries (LMICs) by discovering, developing and delivering new, effective and affordable antimalarial medicines, which are especially needed for children and women, and to fight drug-resistant malaria.</narrative>
  </description>
